{0 ocgraphene}

The {b ocgraphene} package provides OCaml bindings for Graphene:
lightweight 3D transform and geometry types (vectors, matrices, rectangles)
used by Gsk and Gtk. They are generated from Graphene's GObject
introspection data.

{1 Modules}

The library is reached as {!Ocgraphene}, with one module per class, interface or
record, such as {!Ocgraphene.Rect} and {!Ocgraphene.Matrix}.

{ul
{- {{!page-modules}All modules} — every class, interface and record,
   grouped by kind. }
{- {!Ocgraphene.Enums} — enumerations and bitfields. }
{- {!Ocgraphene.Constants} — constants. }
{- {!Ocgraphene.Raw} — the C externals and abstract types the modules above are
   built on. }
}

{1 Dependencies}

It builds on {!Ocglib} (GLib and GObject).
